#tr.en: As for the sector (?) of @varh[t3107.v16]{@wPN{Šu-@wDN{Numušda}} } @vart[t3107.v17,t3107.v16]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} @wPN{Šu-@wDN{Marduk}} } @vart[t3107.v18,t3107.v16]{@varn{1 other ms. has instead:} @wPN{Puzur-@wDN{Numušda}} }, the ruler of @wSN{Ŋirilumtura}: five @fsux{nindan} lengths of it are cut off.
#lem: nam[fate]; Šunumušda[1]PN; ensik[ruler]; GIR₂.lumtura[1]SN
