:15v.1.2: ($1 other ms. has instead:$) puzur₄-{d}nu-muš-da
#lem: Puzurnumušda[1]PN

16. 5 nindan he₂-ni-dar-dar
#tr.en: As for the sector (?) of @wPN{Lugal-melem},
#lem: n; nindan[unit of length]; dar[split]
#etcsl: line-id=16

17. nam {m}lugal-me-lem₄ šabra (1:{id₂}šeg₅-šeg₅:1)
#tr.en: the manager of the @varh[t3107.v19]{@wWN{Šegšeg} watercourse } @vart[t3107.v20,t3107.v19]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} city of @wSN{……} @noteref{the correct form of this name is not known} }: @varh[t3107.v21]{40 } @vart[t3107.v22,t3107.v21]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} 25 } @vart[t3107.v23,t3107.v21]{@varn{1 other ms. has instead:} 30 } @vart[t3107.v24,t3107.v21]{@varn{1 further ms. has instead:} 45 (?) } @fsux{nindan} lengths of …… on top of it are no longer fixed.
#lem: nam[fate]; Lugalmelem[1]; šabra[chief administrator of a temple or other household]; Šegšeg[1]WN
#etcsl: line-id=17

