19. nam {m}KA-kug-ga-ni ensi₂ ma-da MURUB₄{ki}
#tr.en: 45 @fsux{nindan} lengths were destroyed when the opposite side was captured. As for the sector (?) of @wPN{Tākil-ilišu},
#lem: nam[fate]; KAkugani[1]PN; ensik[ruler]; mada[land]; MURUB[1]GN
#etcsl: line-id=19

20. 45 nindan gaba dab₅-ba-bi ba-gul-gul
#tr.en: the @varh[t3107.v25]{canal inspector } @vart[t3107.v26,t3107.v25]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} ruler } of the @wWN{Ab-gal} and @wWN{Me-@wDN{Enlila}} watercourses:
#lem: n; nindan[unit of length]; gaba[breast]; dab[seize]; gul[destroy]
#etcsl: line-id=20

