#tr.en: powers } @vart[t3107.v31,t3107.v30]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} The enemy will replenish his strength for battle }. @vart[t3107.v32,t3107.v32]{@varn{ 1 ms. adds:} I will fortify …… and ……. } His troops are camped among the hills.
